aud compound in Southeast Asia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Seize this rare window of opportunity: evade the guards, gather clues, crack access controls, and escape to freedom!<br>-- Or decide to put an end to the compound\u2019s cruel \u201cfraud operations,\u201d join forces with your companions, destroy its facilities, and send the evidence to the police!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/c0a84f446f0d1da3f0ab27c246a3ab60.avif?t=1756404920\" width=1269 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/afb7964d906712a773e8b08918151509.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up to infiltrate, disrupt the patrols, and rescue each other \u2014 team up with your friends as a \u201cPiglet Squad,\u201d where every anti-fraud breakout becomes a milestone on your road to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/e221cb9091026f16eeab4944f70892c0.avif?t=1756404920\" width=1269 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/6ba34113c20794cb217bad26e39a93a4.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scam evidence, bypass locks and traps; shut down the surveillance room, cut the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >power, plan your escape route, avoid patrols, and find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/51d273c6a2dffa73543bc7fbe9d1a000.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/d6d7a337ebda38d24288a78bd41bedb5.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the area, hide in restrooms, memorize patrol patterns, and unlock shortcuts and hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/cf6733cc8176de9dafe573e63f26c529.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1560 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/a5973060fd577833095828c05244e440.webp?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=60 /></span>Guards, glamorous croupiers, dismemberment doctors, cafeteria chefs, and the compound boss\u2014when you see them, hide or run quickly, and don\u2019t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/828af4fdd793315d628e7ac24c6aa959.avif?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=693 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/7ff1bf8a3858fac4aec8066d43a659d8.webp?t=1756404920\" data-has-big width=1600 height=55 /></span>In the dark, eerie forest, turn on your flashlight, follow the glowing markers to find the signal generator, and call SOS volunteers to drive the rescue vehicle and take you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://